## Syntax highlighting for Visual Studio solution files (.sln)

syntax "Solution" "\.sln$"

## File header line
color brightwhite "^Microsoft Visual Studio Solution File.*$"

## Comment lines (# Visual Studio Version N)
color brightblue "^#.*$"

## Keywords
color brightgreen "\<(Project|EndProject|Global|EndGlobal|GlobalSection|EndGlobalSection|ProjectSection|EndProjectSection)\>"

## GUIDs
color brightcyan "\{[0-9A-Fa-f]{8}-[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}-[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}-[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}-[0-9A-Fa-f]{12}\}"

## Quoted strings (project names and paths)
color yellow ""(\\.|[^"])*""

## Top-level version assignments (e.g., VisualStudioVersion = 17.x.x.x)
color cyan "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9]* = [0-9]"

## Build configuration platforms (e.g., Debug|Any CPU, Release|Any CPU)
color magenta "(Debug|Release)\|[A-Za-z0-9 ]+"

## Trailing whitespace
color ,green "[[:space:]]+$"
